        "method": "Published author proof/core and local context fidelity screening",
        "note": "Complete Theorem7.1, Lemmas7.3-7.5 and the full shuffle bialgebra construction in Proposition6.2/Lemma6.3 read. The finite field, acyclic valued quiver, vertex extensions F_di, Euler-Ringel form, symmetrized grading twist and dual basis rescaling are given in Sections2/5. Green Hall multiplication-coproduct compatibility is expressly prior published background, not an omitted new step. The selected map is formula(7.2), weighted full composition-flag counts, with v the positive square root of the field cardinality and the paper half-power coefficient convention. Neither injectivity, the Feigin-factorization companion nor later KLR/conjectural cluster-monomial conclusions are selected."
