      "statement_scope": "Full Theorem7.1 under the standing finite-field and acyclic valued-quiver hypotheses: formula(7.2) defines a grading-preserving homomorphism from the graded dual Hall-Ringel bialgebra into the paper quantum shuffle bialgebra, with the displayed grading-twisted tensor products. No generic injectivity or conjectural cluster/canonical-basis assertion.",
